    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule.",
    "The closest analog evidence is predicted rather than experimentally measured.",
    "No intravenous comparator data are available for the query.",
    "Potential P-glycoprotein efflux and CYP3A4 metabolism effects on the query are not directly quantified."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

